    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Lay there",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Back of my mind, he stay there",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Pops up time to time like, \"Hey there\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Haven't seen you in two years, but, baby, we still breathe the same air",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "New love and it's almost workin'",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And I never used to be this person",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "But here I am",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Hands on my chest and my knees on the carpet",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Hopin' you'll stop it (Ah)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Dear God",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Take his kiss right out of my brain",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Take the pleasure out of my pain",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Take the way he used to say, \"I love you\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Dear God",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Get his imprint out of my bed",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Take \"amazing\" out of our sex",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Take away the way I still might want to",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "post-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Facts",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "All the memories, babe, I play 'em all, play 'em all, play 'em all, play 'em all back",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "To erase his name, I'd give it all, give it all, give everything that I have",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "All my no-good thoughts, I pray about, pray about, pray about, pray about that",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Take away the way I still might want to",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
